<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mobile Number Verified</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 5px;">
    <h2 style="color: #27ae60;">Mobile Number Verified</h2>
    <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
    <p>Your mobile number <strong>{{mobileNumber}}</strong> has been successfully verified.</p>
    <p>You can now use this mobile number to access all features of our service.</p>
    <br>
    <p>Best regards,</p>
    <p>The Support Team</p>
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;">
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #999;">If you have any questions, please contact us at <a
        href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</body>

</html>